      "writtenOn": "2026-10-22T12:19:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I restructured newly added tests.\nNow we only have 3 tests which is combination of multiple tests which previously existed.\nTests cover following scenarios:\n\n1. multipleSubmitRequirementExpressionKeys_areOrJoined:  checks if ApplicableIf, SubmmitableIf and OverrideableIf are successfully OR joined of multiple entry exists.\n\n2. blankApplicableIfAndOverrideIfExpressionKeyValues_treatedAsAbsent: checks if the value are missing/blank, they are omitted from resulting expressions and are not OR joined.\n\n3. blankSubmittableIfValues_causeValidationError: does not allow to set Submit requirement (SR) with blank/missing SubmittableIf as SubmittableIf is mandatory field for SR.",
      "parentUuid": "01df4e25_d152533d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1488,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 1488,
        "endChar": 52
      },
      "revId": "ede6da3f7f35666cccacc890fcbdb692134e7836",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "269c63fa_a9363758",
        "filename": "javatests/com/google/gerrit/acceptance/api/project/ProjectConfigIT.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
